			"Message": "docs(Grove): Add project documentation files\n\nAdd standard open-source documentation to the Grove element:\n- CHANGELOG.md documenting v1.1 through v2.1 release history\n- CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md based on Contributor Covenant v2.1\n- CONTRIBUTING.md with community guidelines\n- LICENSE using CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain)\n\nThese files establish the governance framework and version history tracking for the WASM extension sandbox component.",
