			],
			"Message": "refactor(Grove): Replace tracing with custom DevLog tag-filtered logging system\n\nIntroduce a new DevLog module providing tag-filtered development logging controlled by the LAND_DEV_LOG environment variable. This replaces the tracing dependency throughout Grove.\n\nKey changes:\n- Add Source/DevLog.rs with tag-based logging (grove, wasm, transport, grpc, extensions, lifecycle, config, ipc, vfs, storage, commands, exthost, model, output, bootstrap)\n- Support LAND_DEV_LOG=all, LAND_DEV_LOG=short for compressed output with path aliasing and deduplication\n- Include OTLP span emission for Jaeger/OpenTelemetry integration\n- Replace all tracing::info/debug/warn/error calls with dev_log! macro throughout the codebase\n- Remove tracing_subscriber initialization from lib.rs and main.rs\n\nThis enables granular control over log verbosity per subsystem while maintaining the same logging interface across Mountain (Rust) and Wind/Sky (TypeScript).",
			"SHA": "dd8750f6e45c3560abdd5324d90fcbcd65f8c4b1"
		},
